  "intuition": "Increase `scale` from ~0.56 to 0.75 to strengthen the pairwise preference signal `alpha*scale*(lpw-lpl)` relative to the fixed cost-gap penalty term `-0.1*gap`. This makes the logits entering `logsigmoid` less dominated by the cost adjustment and helps avoid overly flat gradients when |lpw-lpl| is small, while the existing clamp to [-20, 20] still prevents extreme saturation.",
